得推断UTC时刻或就诊归属。\n旧RCA中的根因、责任科室、PDCA阶段、完成日期、已闭环状态都只是原记录陈述，不构成独立因果审批。\n逐项保留支持与冲突原文，列出所缺证据。逐字引用可核对不表示因果解释正确；先后关系也不证明因果。\n不能推定个人过错、概率、风险降低或实施结果；不生成药物、剂量、阈值或治疗方案，不修改任何临床与管理记录。\n只引用本Source中真实released items的Unicode codepoint [start,end)片段，原样保留BOM、CRLF与emoji。\n只能引用真实人工时间线entry_id，不添加或修补发生时刻；不得把未知填为正常、无异常或未发生。\n只返回规定的JSON对象，不返回Markdown、外部动作、工具调用、根因确认或审核状态。","type":"string"},{"actor_epoch":[457],"catalog_version":[458],"feature_validation":[459],"payload":[460],"provider_snapshot":[461],"run_clock_basis":[346],"schema_version":[462],"source_case_governance":[66],"system_prompt":[463],"task_prompt":[72]},["schema_version","catalog_version","system_prompt","task_prompt","payload","provider_snapshot","feature_validation","source_case_governance","actor_epoch","run_clock_basis"],{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":[464],"required":[465],"type":"object"},{"RcaActorEpoch":[242],"RcaArtifactRecord":[247],"RcaAuditRecord":[253],"RcaFrozenProvider":[323],"RcaFrozenValidation":[331],"RcaPhaseAudits":[452],"RcaPieceLocations":[387],"RcaRawFrozenJson":[429],"RcaResultReference":[433],"RcaShortContext":[397],"RcaStoredPayload":[456],"RcaTaskBinding":[405],"RcaTaskEvidence":[409],"RcaTaskFindings":[437],"RcaTaskGrant":[412],"RcaTaskMetadata":[362],"RcaTaskSelection":[439],"RcaTaskSnapshot":[466],"RcaUsageReceipt":[367],"SourceGovernance":[93]},{"const":"not_evaluated_or_regranted_by_frozen_audit","type":"string"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/RcaTaskSnapshot"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/RcaPhaseAudits"},{"$ref":"#/$defs/RcaRawFrozenJson"},{"context_digest":[5],"context_metadata":[332],"create_time":[13],"current_case_governance":[66],"current_case_governance_hash":[5],"current_source_execution_qualification":[468],"encounter_ref":[14],"error_code":[334],"error_message":[337],"evidence":[416],"feature_key":[134],"feature_name":[338],"finish_time":[16],"frozen_request":[469],"input_tokens":[341],"latency_ms":[344],"output_tokens":[341],"parts":[441],"patient_id":[14],"phase_audits":[470],"preview":[345],"pro